<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Welcome to <%= @app_name %></title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #22c55e; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #22c55e; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Welcome to <%= @app_name %>! 🌽</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,</p>
    
    <p>Welcome to MyStandMap - your connection to local Wisconsin farmers, farm stands, and fresh produce!</p>
    
    <p>Here's what you can do:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse farm stands, u-pick farms, and farmers markets</li>
      <li>Search by city, name, or products</li>
      <li>Get directions to local stands</li>
      <li>Claim your own stand if you're a farmer</li>
    </ul>
    
    <p>
      <%= link_to "Explore Local Stands", stands_url, class: "button" %>
    </p>
    
    <p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p>
    
    <p>Happy exploring!</p>
    
    <p>- The MyStandMap Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© <%= Date.current.year %> MyStandMap - Connecting Wisconsin with Local Food</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
